 - 2026-06-17: PHASE B2 (ARC NORTH STAR; operator MANDATORY 2026-06-17) -- E3 ka59 -> L1 with EXPLORE-VERIFY-PLAN, same upgraded harness as exp4339. .400 (exp4328) reached verifier_best_accuracy 0.56 on ka59 (offline_reproduced=false). Apply AERA explore-verify-plan (arXiv:2605.25931) + Agent2World adaptive world-model testing (arXiv:2512.22336): EXPLORE collects verifier-gated transition lemmas, PLAN only after the model passes mechanic checks. The codex agent IS the proposer (WRITES results/arc_e3/ka59/world_model.py; NO nested CodexProposer). INCREMENTAL-PROGRESS scoped: +1 level (L1). HARD gate: offline_reproduced=true AND reproduced_levels>=1. An honest partial (best verifier_accuracy + the residual mismatch class as a missing-world-model-rule gap) is PROGRESS. verifier_is_oracle=true (execution-grounded ARC progress, NOT a moat). NO TRM training; NO leaderboard submission; cap per-task wall-time. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=complete_e3_ka59_partial_model_0.56; results/experiment_4340_e3_explore_verify_plan_ka59.json
 - 2026-06-17: PHASE C (ARC NORTH STAR; biggest reproducible-level upside) -- E3 executable-world-model on sc25 to CRACK the win-mechanic the BFS solver stalled on, and REPRODUCE L1 offline. sc25 has 5 LIVE-RECORDED levels but 0 reproduced (the live trajectory does NOT replay offline; the from-scratch BFS solver arc3_sc25_offline_solver.py works infra-wise but is 'blocked on the win-mechanic'). The registry has rich mechanic notes: MULTIPLE win paths (move player 'pluyoo' to exit; OR align 9 'clcbko' goal sprites to the 3x3 cast grid at +1,+1), ACTION6 click to select spell + toggle 3x3 cast cells at (24+5c,49+5r) + fire, ACTION1-4 tank-controls move. The E3 approach (INDUCE the spell/cast-grid/tank-control mechanic as an executable Python world model, the WorldModelVerifier grounds it) is the DIFFERENT approach vs the stalled BFS. Same explore-verify-plan harness as exp4339 (AERA 2605.25931 + Agent2World 2512.22336). The codex agent IS the proposer (WRITES results/arc_e3/sc25/world_model.py; NO nested CodexProposer). HARD gate: offline_reproduced=true AND reproduced_levels>=1 (a +1, opening the path to the 5 live-recorded levels -> up to +5 reproducible). An honest partial (best verifier_accuracy + the win-mechanic gap CLASS) is PROGRESS. verifier_is_oracle=true (execution-grounded). NO TRM training; NO leaderboard submission; cap per-task wall-time. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success_e3_sc25_L1_reproduced; results/experiment_4341_e3_sc25_reproduction.json
